A '''Glossy Gemstone''' is an {{Epic}} item obtained by mining [[Gemstone]]s during the [[Mining Fiesta]] event.

== Obtaining ==
'''Glossy Gemstones''' have a chance to drop when mining [[File:Lime Stained Glass.png|21px|link=]] [[Gemstone]]s on {{green|Public Islands}} during a [[File:Mining Fiesta.png|21px|link=]] [[Mining Fiesta|{{orange|Mining Fiesta}}]], following the formula below and its {{aqua|'''additive'''}} multipliers:
<math>\displaystyle\text{Chance} = \frac{{\color{darkgreen}\text{Breaking Power}}}{5,000}\times \left( 1+ \sum{\text{Multipliers}}\right)</math>
:Where <math>\sum{\text{Multipliers}}</math> is the sum of the multipliers.
